                                                Zhang Jiayu; Baohua Zhang; <span style="font-weight: bold; color: #920b0b;">Innocent Nyalala</span>; Peter Mecha; Junlong Chen; Kunjie Chen; Junfeng Gao.
                                                <br/> <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aiia.2024.11.004"><font size="4px"> Rectifying the extremely weakened signals for cassava leaf disease detection</font></a>
                                                <span class="tag" style="font-size: 11px; color: #ecf4f1;">Journal Article</span>
                                                <br/>In: Computers and Electronics in Agriculture, vol. 232, pp. 1101047, May 2025. 
